Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.30,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:07.14,Default,,0,0,900,,Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.14,0:00:12.84,Default,,0,0,900,,Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:18.54,Default,,0,0,900,,He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.36,0:00:24.94,Default,,0,0,900,,does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.54,0:00:30.76,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:36.50,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:42.30,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:47.70,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:01:00.06,Default,,0,0,900,,I am calling, calling now. Spirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:05.50,Default,,0,0,900,,To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:11.82,Default,,0,0,900,,Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:17.32,Default,,0,0,900,,in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.80,0:01:23.30,Default,,0,0,900,,To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.30,0:01:28.70,Default,,0,0,900,,The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:33.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The noise on the police notice was\Na fragment of a latent virus...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.13,0:01:40.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wasn't there to begin with!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.93,0:01:44.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Togusa, He's been watching through the S.I.D.'s eye\Nall along... Then I'll just trace him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:46.65,BLACK,,0,0,850,,{\b0\i1}TRANSMIT{\b1\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.53,0:01:54.38,Default,,650,0,500,,The \N Copycat \N Dances
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.09,0:02:02.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,My work here is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.89,0:02:07.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now, what shall I do before S.I.D.\Ncomes and finds this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.06,0:02:17.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Detected a signal that violates\Nthe Cyberbrain Ethics Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.66,0:02:19.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Possibility of a cyber brain hack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.66,0:02:22.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All members check your cyber brain functionality.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.56,0:02:24.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Be alert for any suspicious movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.46,0:02:28.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief, split-type virus confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.66,0:02:31.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It'll be impossible to determine\Nthe type until it activates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.26,0:02:37.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Judging from the noise,\Nthe target must be one of the SP's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.86,0:02:41.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No sign of remote signals,\Nso it's probably a self-running program.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.96,0:02:48.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder who'll be hacked... That should be\Nat least expected, even if it is a setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:05.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's closer than we thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.77,0:03:08.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You! What do you think you're doin-! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.07,0:03:14.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was just as you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.07,0:03:14.27,BLACK,,0,450,800,,MESSAGE SENT
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.57,0:03:17.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If I had sent the virus from my house,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.77,0:03:21.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I probably would have been caught by those cops,\Nwho jumped the gun before I completed the virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:25.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That would fail me as the "Laughing Man"...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.47,0:03:30.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But aren't you here a little early?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:40.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Weren't the cops supposed to track this place down from the logs\Non my room's terminal, and then arrest me as I fled?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.47,0:03:42.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:46.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No... It's just as we planned...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:50.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, you're joking right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:54.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you kill me, who are you going\Nto arrest as the "Laughing Man"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.57,0:03:59.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't worry. You being alive\Nor dead isn't really a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.37,0:04:02.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All I need is the fact that\Nyou were the "Laughing Man".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.97,0:04:07.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, don't worry, you'll be more\Nfamous in history this way...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:08.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:26.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.33,0:04:31.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So it has begun...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.74,0:04:41.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,General, we found the possibility\Nof a cyber brain hack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.14,0:04:46.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We will check the cyber brain activity of all\Nguests, including the SP, immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:49.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please postpone your speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.94,0:04:55.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All members be ready in F2 formation, until we've\Ndetermined those who are infected with the virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:55.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.24,0:04:57.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who are you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:04:59.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stop! Tell me your division and active name!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:00.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:04.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Those who are the highest risk of being\Ninfected with the virus are you SP's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.94,0:05:10.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,An analysis of the latent virus left in the\Nperiodical messages, leaves only 2 possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:15.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The commanding officers who have the\Nkey to the code converter, or everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.48,0:05:24.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:25.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.04,0:05:28.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:36.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stop them! Don't let them get near the General!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.82,0:05:38.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The rest of you quickly...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:45.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,IT'S THE BEGINNING OF THE PURGE!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:03.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is just perfect for training.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.54,0:06:08.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you don't want to spend the rest of your life\Nafter retirement in an IC unit, stay out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.81,0:06:10.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Shit...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.03,0:06:29.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This sure was a superb performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.71,0:06:47.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh? Someone has copied the virus online!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:50.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,An attack barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.28,0:06:54.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:56.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good thing I put it through a substitute barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:06:59.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A virus with a trap?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.68,0:07:00.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.68,0:07:05.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who was looking into this man's brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.99,0:07:22.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh? It's open...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:23.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did they get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.11,0:07:48.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,One shot from close range.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.41,0:07:52.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A silencer was used too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.41,0:07:54.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What the hell does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.91,0:07:59.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Weren't they planning on feeding him to S.I.D.\Nas the "Laughing Man" to draw the curtains?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.81,0:08:02.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:06.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This could be like a lizard\Ncasting off its tail...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.11,0:08:10.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Anyways, his face...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.11,0:08:14.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Heh, he's laughing...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.19,0:08:18.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nanao was eliminated?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.59,0:08:21.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Shit, they've got us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:27.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Record as much info on the situation as you\Ncan, and leave before S.I.D. arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:28.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The dead won't tell us anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.29,0:08:30.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.59,0:08:34.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief, I'll send you a copy of what is\Nbelieved to be the virus that Nanao sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.39,0:08:39.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The only one that it reacted to was the\Ncommander who had the key to the code converter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:42.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, I don't think there's\Nanyone else it'll react to,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.19,0:08:43.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but just in case, make an antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.49,0:08:46.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Got it. I'll have it made immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.62,0:08:53.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nanao was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.82,0:08:54.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.02,0:08:56.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's a well written script.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:09:01.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah... That was a superb performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.02,0:09:03.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But there is one thing that's bugging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.62,0:09:07.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,While I was trying to get a copy\Nof Nanao's virus, someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.22,0:09:11.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.82,0:09:14.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Move out of the way!\NMove back, and make way! Move back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.32,0:09:16.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, hey! It's the main secretary, Tajimaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:17.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Move Back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:22.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Make an anti-virus, quickly!\NI have a bad feeling about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:24.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Pazu, keep an eye on the General.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:26.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Saitou, check the surrounding area.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.22,0:09:26.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:33.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm the Laughing Man! I will kill the General!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.07,0:09:42.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Has the latent virus reacted?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.11,0:09:46.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What just happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.61,0:09:50.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.18,0:09:56.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.98,0:10:01.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Daidou! Tell the truth or die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.18,0:10:06.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Daidou!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.18,0:10:09.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Give us a hand immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:12.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A group suspected to be accomplices\Nof the "Laughing Man" has-...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.18,0:10:13.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Looks like he didn't hit a critical spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.08,0:10:17.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There still may be more people\Ninfected with the virus. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.88,0:10:22.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I repeat, a large number of the "Laughing\NMan's" accomplices have infiltrated the venue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.38,0:10:23.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Give us some backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.48,0:10:26.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.38,0:10:29.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Get an ambulance to the basement parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.48,0:10:31.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief, is the antidote ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.28,0:10:35.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I need a little more time, what exactly happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.98,0:10:38.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It seems as though there isn't any\Ntime to be sending you the visual.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:40.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just hurry up on the antidote, for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.58,0:10:43.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Saitou, any suspicious movements\Nin the surrounding area?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.18,0:10:43.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Ishikawa...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.18,0:10:43.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Searching...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.98,0:10:45.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What about the Tachikomas the Major took with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.78,0:10:47.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Other than the one Saitou has,\Nthere's two that are free.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.08,0:10:51.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Alright, back the Major up with those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:52.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bouma, hurry up with the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.08,0:10:53.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.38,0:10:57.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,MOVE BACK!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.18,0:11:00.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Move back people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.58,0:11:03.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was a policeman; it appears that\Na policeman has shot Mr. Daidou.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.88,0:11:05.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is beyond being just a setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:07.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Could this be the truth?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:09.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.12,0:11:09.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.72,0:11:12.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.24,0:11:20.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, we've got one here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:25.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There may still be more,\Ndon't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.54,0:11:27.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.66,0:11:33.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, I'm finished with the\Nantidote, but like you said,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:38.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,it'll only react with the SP's\Nkey to the code converter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:42.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It appears that what is causing this\Ncommotion, isn't the virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.66,0:11:45.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then what is causing this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:11:59.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hyoukoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:13.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major! I've come for back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.66,0:12:17.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're late! Keep him restrained!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:17.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:35.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Daidou! Prepare to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.02,0:12:46.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn, how many of them are there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.91,0:13:04.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Laughing Man",\Nyou're under arrest for attempted murder!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.01,0:13:07.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, I've caught the "Laughing Man".
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.62,0:13:11.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Excuse me? Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.82,0:13:16.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Which way is it to the hotel, where the\Nassassination of the General is being held?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.85,0:13:18.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.38,0:13:31.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.98,0:13:37.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't worry about me.\NGo gather information on what happened here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:39.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.25,0:13:55.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll tell you again, Mr. Policeman, don't ask\Ndumb questions you already know the answer to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.45,0:13:57.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The "Laughing Man",
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.15,0:13:59.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I AM the "L-A-U-G-H-I-N-G M-A-N".
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.65,0:14:02.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Everyone else is a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:04.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm the only real one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.81,0:14:09.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That was a message sent to\Nme by the "Laughing Man".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.61,0:14:15.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That assassination proclamation was a message\Ntelling me to become the "Laughing Man".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.81,0:14:20.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, from what I remember, I didn't hear\Nit telling you to assassinate the General.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.63,0:14:30.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How about opening your mouth?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:34.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are all these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.73,0:14:38.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have no clue... They don't seem like\Nordinary fans of the "Laughing Man" to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.13,0:14:43.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This incident has made things even more unclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.53,0:14:47.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Other than the SP that was\Ninfected by Nanao's virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.73,0:14:52.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The others that attempted to assassinate the General were influenced\Nby the assassination announcement, and acted on their own...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.33,0:14:54.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's what I hear them saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.93,0:14:58.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are also those claiming to\Nbe the "Laughing Man" themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.03,0:15:01.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They're all the same, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.73,0:15:02.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.12,0:15:09.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As I thought,\Nthere is no evidence of brain-washing,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.42,0:15:12.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,or any clue as to being affected by a virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:16.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Although we can't be too sure until\Nwe do a more thorough examination,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.02,0:15:21.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There will most likely be no\Nevidence of an external factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:22.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that so? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.67,0:15:26.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll leave the rest to you two. Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.87,0:15:28.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.17,0:15:29.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A little something with the Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.07,0:15:31.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A date?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.27,0:15:35.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was just joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.87,0:15:40.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How does coffee of the police headquarters taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.67,0:15:43.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's not to my taste...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:48.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're going to the hospital, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.28,0:15:50.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, you knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.70,0:16:01.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,General Daidou will probably be made to retire early\Nduring his hospitalization.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.87,0:16:04.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What about the Police's official\Nannouncement on the case?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.77,0:16:12.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A wide range cyber brain contamination by a virus made by Ei\NNanao, who is thought to be the original "Laughing Man".
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.57,0:16:15.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think the media will go with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:17.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What about Nanao's death?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:21.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The "Laughing Man" Case\Nwas the work of multiple culprits,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.37,0:16:25.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and Nanao was killed due to\Nsome trouble inside the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:29.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The purpose of the assassination\Nannouncement is unclear,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.57,0:16:35.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but the SID says there are\Nnew developments in the case
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.67,0:16:39.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and they will proceed with further investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.37,0:16:43.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was a magnificent curtain call for a setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.87,0:16:45.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't be so sarcastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.97,0:16:48.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What? That was supposed to be a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.69,0:17:01.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Anyways, aside from the police announcement,\Nthose are what I call, imitators,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.99,0:17:03.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do you think they were?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.79,0:17:07.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Three of them claim to be the\N"Laughing Man" themselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.09,0:17:11.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Two were influenced by the "Laughing\NMan" to carry out the assassination,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.59,0:17:16.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Three were saying that the announcement was a\Nmessage directed at them, ordering them to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.09,0:17:21.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If we include those arrested for suspicious\Nactivity around the ceremony venue,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.09,0:17:27.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,a total of 39 people imitators of the "Laughing\NMan" have been caught all at one time...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.19,0:17:33.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They have never plotted with each other, nor do\Nthey have any religious connections between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.89,0:17:39.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There is no evidence of being\Nbrainwashed or any external factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.29,0:17:45.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Those who wouldn't be suspected\Nof being the "Laughing Man"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.39,0:17:51.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,took up terrorism, after watching the\Nassassination announcement on the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.09,0:17:55.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.91,0:18:03.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In theatrical plays,\Neven the audience is part of the play.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.61,0:18:07.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That doesn't answer my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.11,0:18:16.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, like you said, I also think an internal police\Ncover-up using Ei Nanao as a decoy does exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.11,0:18:22.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But I keep getting the feeling that the rioting\Nby the imitators was distinct from that plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.61,0:18:26.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,From this point on,\Na different reality has started.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.18,0:18:36.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, I was surprised by it too,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:40.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but I guess we have to keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:45.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A lot happened, even though we\Nprepared this before hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.00,0:18:45.00,BLACK,,0,0,550,,No \N Visitors \N Allowed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:48.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, yeah, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.40,0:18:52.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Though I regret retiring early,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.80,0:19:00.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,due to our current circumstances, I believe it's best\Nto remove everyone who has connections to this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.90,0:19:04.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, my retirement plans are already...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:06.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.90,0:19:12.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, and I hope for our good\Nfortune in the near future.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.51,0:19:18.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.51,0:19:25.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sorry to hear that you were injured\N but I'm glad that you are okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:27.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is it that you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.41,0:19:29.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm in the middle of recuperating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.21,0:19:32.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you not see the sign on the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.81,0:19:36.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I thought that I wouldn't hurt to thank my men...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:38.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.91,0:19:43.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,By the way, I hear that Amsterdam is\Na nice place to live in the summer...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:52.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm now able to make a decision,\Ndue to this incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.39,0:19:57.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Heh, are you going to retire too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.19,0:20:04.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To find the truth within the case of the "Laughing Man",\NPublic Safety Section 9 will begin our own investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.89,0:20:08.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I came here today, to inform you of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.69,0:20:12.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When the investigation begins,\NI have many things to talk
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.73,0:20:16.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,to you about regarding the\Nmovement of money with SERANO...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.14,0:20:21.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, I would advise that you rest\Nwhile you are able to do so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.44,0:21:04.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was really worried when I heard\Nyou got into an accident, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.34,0:21:07.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm happy for you, dad.\NI'm glad that the injury wasn't very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.84,0:21:10.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hahaha, I'm sorry, I made you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.75,0:21:16.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.88,0:21:22.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Everything's stained the same colour.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:28.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Eh. Anyway, to answer your question,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.48,0:21:36.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I believe that there is no actual\Nsuspect in the "Laughing Man" case.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.22,0:21:41.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The recent situation seems to have been seeded\Nfrom something buried 6 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.52,0:21:46.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that began sprouting with\Nthe assassination notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.92,0:21:56.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And the imitators are a Stand Alone Complex brought about\Nby this phenomenon, ultimately just copies without an original.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.82,0:21:59.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You really believe there is\Nno original "Laughing Man"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.02,0:22:08.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then what was the thing that was watching\Nus when we looked into that SP's brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:15.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major, don't go around trying to\Nfit in pieces that don't fit yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.22,0:22:19.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,From tomorrow on, we'll have to build\Nup a much larger puzzle from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:22.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.12,0:22:25.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.72,0:22:29.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Can you tell Togusa...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.12,0:22:33.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,to put flowers on Yamaguchi's grave?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.32,0:22:39.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The person that brought light to\Nthis case was none other than he.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.92,0:22:41.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.05,0:23:18.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.95,0:23:22.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.93,0:23:26.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.26,0:23:30.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.24,0:23:34.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.70,0:23:39.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.33,0:23:42.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.00,0:23:47.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But wake a lithium flower, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.15,0:23:49.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.84,0:23:54.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.24,0:23:59.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.44,0:23:59.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.14,0:24:02.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.54,0:24:04.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.11,0:24:07.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.11,0:24:10.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.42,0:24:13.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When she wakes up
